OL,3,ABurnham promises more devolution and
OL,4,Apublic control of essential services
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has promised to set out
OL,7,Fplans for "stronger public control" of
OL,8,Fessential services as he addressed the
OL,9,FHouse of Commons for the first time
OL,10,Fsince taking power.
OL,12,FThe prime minister said "a series of
OL,13,Fwrong turns" since the 1980s had seen
OL,14,Feconomic power in the UK privatised and
OL,15,Fpointed to the water industry as "a
OL,16,Fleaking monument to that approach - a
OL,17,Fcountry run in the private rather than
OL,18,Fpublic interest".
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
